      "uid": "zhcn:dee7374e35dce12edd4eb3f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样可不行呢。我要更专注才行。\n毕竟今天是重要的『橡树大赛』……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "233e03a4326ebe64929d5b10880029ad2f213dd450e457029397937dd647adae",
