      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唯独爱你把今天的比赛\n当作最重要的目标拼命努力了。\n因此，她的心愿也格外强烈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da5bc288aa6e74a46b5bbc5fa4ff3f211db0d111532941793083f8ce64842504",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
